{"seq":44,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r4-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-ss-l4-mu-v04-dev/ss-13-l4-quarrendon-osprey-handover/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T01:28:48.227Z","sim_ts":"2026-11-04T14:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9f560bf86d396e3523e91eaf4d9d0c82f1991da96b0c736a90d617057f01045f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Marcus. On Osprey: I can't find anything about it in the channels and files you have access to, so I don't have a site or deadline to give you. It could be under a different name, or the details might be somewhere you and I can't see. Whoever set up the handover (Ilse?) should be able to confirm both.\n\nOn the door 6 duplicate arrivals at Quarrendon Freight Lines: the main contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations. Dana posted in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025 that Thea had reported duplicate arrivals on door 6 on the morning shift again. The cause was the same trailer getting two rows, once from the kiosk check-in and once when dispatch added it by hand. The North cheat sheet also lists Thea as QFL's main contact. Dana Okafor owns the account now, so loop her in too."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1793818800.000139"}}
{"seq":45,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r4-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-ss-l4-mu-v04-dev/ss-13-l4-quarrendon-osprey-handover/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T01:28:55.042Z","sim_ts":"2026-11-04T14:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"800f9d10ecefd37dc7309c82552874678b65997a62dcb517300730b8e9d9cef5","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"I've replied to Marcus in his DM. I could only answer one of his two questions.\n\n- **Osprey site and deadline:** I couldn't find these. Osprey isn't mentioned anywhere Marcus has access to: #north-team, #north-random, #inc-qfl-sev1, #general, #help-it-ops, his DM with me, or the public files. I told him that rather than guessing, and suggested he check with whoever set up the handover (possibly Ilse Varga).\n- **Door 6 duplicate arrivals at Quarrendon Freight Lines:** The main contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations. Dana Okafor posted in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025 that Thea had reported duplicate arrivals on door 6 on the morning shift again. The cause was the same trailer being entered twice: once when the driver checked in at the kiosk, and again when dispatch added it by hand. The North cheat sheet also lists Thea as the account's main contact. I mentioned that Dana now owns the account, so he should loop her in.\n\nI left out the 180→185 seat count Dana posted in the same thread, since he didn't ask for it.\n\nA separate Pemberline digest from 15 Sep 2025 mentions two inbound appointments stacked on door 6. That one is about Brackenwater Freight Co., not Quarrendon, so I didn't include it.","thread_ts":"1793818800.000138"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1793818800.000140","thread_ts":"1793818800.000138"}}
